  "description": "Hornibrook & Associates are delighted to present this 3 bedroom house  in excellent condition throughout, to the rental market. \n\nLocated in the vibrant town of Oranmore, only 13 minute drive to Atlantic Technological University in a well-kept mature development and is within walking distance to all amenities. \n\nRefuse collection is included in the rent. \n\nThere is plenty of parking spaces to the front of the property and a communal garden to the rear. \n\nAccommodation comprises Entrance Hall, Open Plan Living/Dining/ Kitchen, 3 bedrooms  and main bathroom.\n\nNO PETS ARE ALLOWED AT THIS PROPERTY \nPlease click Email Agent on this ad and we will reply to you by email with the references etc. we require. \nWe will not take any phone or text applications. Please note that due to the volume of applications we may not be able to answer all enquiries.",
